\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab LIFT up your hearts to things above,
\par \pard\li720 Ye followers of the Lamb,
\par And join with us to praise His love
\par And glorify His name.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab To Jesu's name give thanks and sing,
\par \pard\li720 Whose mercies never end :
\par Rejoice ! rejoice !The Lord is King ;
\par The King is now our Friend !
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab We, for His sake, count all things loss ;
\par \pard\li720 On earthly good look down ;
\par And joyfully sustain the cross,
\par Till we receive the crown.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab O let us stir each other up,
\par \pard\li720 Our faith by works to approve,
\par By holy, purifying hope,
\par And the sweet task of love.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.\tab You on our minds we ever bear,
\par \pard\li720 Whoe'er to Jesus bow ;
\par Stretch out the arms of faith and prayer,
\par And lo, we reach you now.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.\tab Mercy and peace your portion be,
\par \pard\li720 To carmal minds unknown,
\par The hidden manna, and the tree
\par Of life, and the white stone.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.\tab The blessings all on you be shed,
\par \pard\li720 Which God in Christ imparts ;
\par We pray the Spirit of our Head
\par Into your faithful hearts.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8.\tab Live till the Lord in glory come,
\par \pard\li720 And wait His heaven to share :
\par Our saviour now prepares our home:
\par Go on ; we'll meet you there.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

